  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "30A Pet Friendly Beach House rental, Pelican's Rest, located in Inlet Beach, FL by Panhandle Getaways is a 4 bedroom, 3 bathroom beach vacation home complete with all of the conveniences of home. 4 Bikes Included, Pet Friendly<br><br><br>Free Activities Included. see details below***<br><br><br>FEATURES<br>* 30A - 4 Bedroom, 3.5 Bathroom Beach House<br>* Pet Friendly **<br>* Large Living Area - Large Smart TV<br>* Fully Equipped Kitchen with Breakfast Bar<br>* Dining Area<br>* Bedroom 1 - King Bed, Day Bed (Twin), Smart TV, En Suite Bathroom<br>* Bedroom 2 - King Bed, Smart TV, En Suite Bathroom<br>* Bedroom 3 - Queen Bed, Smart TV<br>* Bathroom 3 - Spacious Tub/Shower Combo<br>* Bedroom 4 - Bunk Bed (F/F), Smart TV<br>* Laundry Room - Full Size Washer/Dryer<br>* Outdoor Seating Area<br>* Complimentary High Speed Wi-Fi<br>* Sleeps 11<br><br><br>PET FRIENDLY WITH STIPULATIONS **<br>We welcome well trained dogs to stay in this home. If traveling with a pet, please note that a non-refundable pet fee will be added after booking. We require that your dog be completely potty trained and prefer dogs older than 2 years old. Crate Trained pups are preferred to deter mischievous behavior while you and your party are enjoying the beach. It is understood that while we do allow dogs with the mentioned stipulations any damages that occur during your stay will be charged to the credit card on file with the minimum fee being $350.00. ADDITIONAL PET FEE APPLIES & IS COLLECTED AFTER BOOKING IS MADE.<br><br><br>About Inlet Heights, Inlet Beach, FL<br>Inlet Heights is a neighborhood of the Grande Pointe at Inlet Beach community located just east of Rosemary Beach, and this Inlet Beach community has it all. The community pool overlooks Lake Powell, the largest coastal dune lake in Florida. Just 3/10 mile from the Gulf of Mexico with multiple public beach accesses in Inlet Beach, this prime location gives you access to nearby shopping and dining at 30Avenue, Rosemary Beach, and all of Scenic 30A. Enjoy the private community dock on Lake Powell and the community pavilion. You can also fish, hike and kayak at nearby Camp Helen State Park.<br><br><br>Community Highlights<br>Community Pool<br>Lake Powell <br>Public Beach Access<br>Easy Access to Shopping and Dining<br>Family Friendly<br><br><br>Bonus***Guests receive 1 free daily admission to some of our favorite local attractions through our partnership with Xplorie. All perks are valid for stays up to 27 days and are subject to change and availability. BONUS PERKS INCLUDED WITH YOUR STAY:<br><br>* 1 FREE Round of Golf at 1 of 4 Golf Courses in the area Every Day - Year Round<br>* 4 Bikes - Ready to Go at the Home - Year Round<br>* 1 FREE Voucher to use for an unforgettable Dolphin Cruise and/or Snorkel trip Each Day! (Mar-Oct)<br><br><br>INITIAL SUPPLIES - UPON ARRIVAL<br>Panhandle Getaways furnishes a few essential items for guests to utilize until they can get to the grocery store. Initial Supplies include: Dishwasher soap, small washing machine powder, each bathroom has amenities (like hotel but NOT restocked) shampoo, conditioner, soap bar. One roll of toilet paper in each bathroom & one paper towel roll in the kitchen. All bed linens and towels are provided. We encourage guests to bring beach towels for use at the pool and beach.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
