            "id": "151be2ce-f3d8-4151-8ea8-48ac12d7e760",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for your fantastic feedback, Swanson! We're delighted to hear that the house was perfect for your stay during the softball tournament. It's great to know that the ample beds, three bathrooms, proximity to the beach, and community pool added to your convenience and enjoyment.\n\nWe're also pleased that the well-supplied kitchen allowed you to cook and enjoy meals together. Your high recommendation means a lot to us, and we look forward to welcoming you and your family back for another wonderful stay!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We were in town for a softball tournament and while the house was about 30 minutes from the tournament site it was perfect. A bed for everyone, three baths was very convenient for the 9 of us. Close to the beach and a community pool was very nice. A well supplied kitchen allowed us to cook and not go out to eat every night. I would highly recommend this house for families.",
